## Preserved authority boundaries

`Observed != Validated` remains unchanged.

Adapter-declared dimension support means only that the resolved adapter explicitly exposes an explorable candidate space. It does not mean a value is beneficial, measured, validated, recommended, safe to persist or authorized to mutate the machine/workload.

Typed evidence, repeatability, Global Controlled Benchmark Lease, exact fingerprint/freshness, validation challenge, ValidatedEvidence, winner/profile authority and rollback/history remain the authority chain.
